Reach out to your
Google Cloud rep

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.380
to learn how you can deploy
visual inspection solutions

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.480
using cloud AI products.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:42.270
And visit the Google Cloud
